      {
        "id": "book001-b000701-p000-0a247af305",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "如果神位缺失而贪狼星位显现，家中资产会繁荣兴盛，少年人也会发达。如果水从朝向上方揖拜而来，必定见家中中房（次子房）福禄强盛。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000702-p000-d5161a8f8f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "神位缺失渐渐会导致家业荣昌，田产增加，金玉满堂。御街引马随着水流而至，如同万里云霄直上高昂。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000703-p000-51fab87bb1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "角穴属于计都星，对应河魁星，五行属土，主破败，对应巽卦，对应白虎方位，是天败、天突、天刑、晦气之星。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000704-p000-3e3dca80ac",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "计都星主人服毒身亡，悖逆的儿孙被发配远方。家中发生内乱，遭遇蛇伤和火灾，瘟癀风疾会伤害主人。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000705-p000-7ddd41f923",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "计都星又主少年死亡，水浸死尸却是在池塘中。先产生白蚁后生水，必定有流徒悖逆的郎君。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000706-p000-9596e83f0c",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "耳穴属于木星，对应登明，五行属水，对应危宿，对应斗宿，对应武曲星，对应玉堂，对应禄库，对应天库，对应临官位，对应少微星，对应一金，对应和吉。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000707-p000-f23649f83e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "木星朝穴向难以遇到，此穴须知众吉昌。长房发家资财盛，人旺财豪富贵乡。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000708-p000-92851004c6",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "亡人紫茜生棺椁，木根水蚁定无伤。田蚕牛马俱兴旺，贵享钟禄万仓。子贵。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000709-p000-33b8c0cf29",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "腰穴属于月孛星，对应神后，五行属水，对应成宿，对应牛宿，对应廉贞星，对应天牢，对应天。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000710-p000-8ea6b7a78f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "瘟，对应天刑，对应虚宿。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000711-p000-9f9a4c3724",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "月孛凶星主少亡，公事投河及产伤。自吊更招家内乱，官灾火盗急须防。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000712-p000-a4d42273b4",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "棺内更多生白蚁，目盲更有病连床。劳瘵传尸多夭折，偏多横事恼心肠。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000713-p000-e21fe75f28",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "足穴是水星，属于大吉，属于土，代表奴仆，代表女性，是禄存星，是元武，是天耗，是地耗，是伪。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000714-p000-5618615608",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "水星凶曜主何殃，罹赖官司公事忙。多因室女生公讼，脚病风波更夭亡。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000715-p000-a2111b9176",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "水曜原来白蚁多，却来面上做泥窝。水浸乾时蛇鼠入，岁岁年年被鬼魔。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000716-p000-995c26c3d8",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "鼻穴属于金星，对应功曹，五行属土，对应开宿，对应虚宿，对应巨门星，对应司命，对应文星，对应天官，对应凤辇，对应真。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000717-p000-3478a4e66a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "西方太白吉星辰，定主儿孙德业荣。资财进益田园盛，更兼富贵旺人丁。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000718-p000-d62718b7b5",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "肠穴属于土星，对应太冲，五行属木，对应闭宿，对应危宿，对应廉贞星，对应勾陈，对应天灾，对应狼籍，对应小祸，对应乖。",
